      "skills": "solve-equations-with-variable-exponents",
      "question_text": "Solve for s.\n\n8^{s} = 64\n\ns = ____. Simplify your answer.",
      "question_type": "Fill in the blank",
      "correct_answers": [
        "2"
      ],
      "solution": [
        [
          "text",
          "We need to find what power of 8 equals 64."
        ],
        [
